{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XU7NWFxd8MQkWcwrvZbTkv","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Mistral FIM fill-in-the-middle models support\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Codestral 25.01 | Mistral AI\",\"url\":\"https://mistral.ai/news/codestral-2501/\"},{\"title\":\"Outscale | Mistral Docs\",\"url\":\"https://docs.mistral.ai/deployment/cloud/outscale\"},{\"title\":\"Codestral - Mistral AI | Mistral Docs\",\"url\":\"https://docs.mistral.ai/models/model-cards/codestral-25-08\"},{\"title\":\"Announcing Codestral 25.08 and the Complete Mistral Coding Stack for Enterprise | Mistral AI\",\"url\":\"https://mistral.ai/news/codestral-25-08/\"},{\"title\":\"Models - from cloud to edge | Mistral\",\"url\":\"https://mistral.ai/models/\"},{\"title\":\"Codestral | Mistral AI\",\"url\":\"https://mistral.ai/news/codestral/\"},{\"title\":\"StarCoder: may the source be with you!\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2305.06161\"},{\"title\":\"Fim Endpoints - Mistral AI Documentation\",\"url\":\"https://docs.mistral.ai/api/endpoint/fim\"},{\"title\":\"StarCoder 2 and The Stack v2: The Next Generation\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2402.19173\"},{\"title\":\"Planning-Aware Code Infilling via Horizon-Length Prediction\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2410.03103\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about Mistral FIM (Fill-in-the-Middle) models support:\n\n## Mistral's FIM Support\n\nCodestral is Mistral's family of code generation models built specifically for high-precision fill-in-the-middle (FIM) completion. Codestral supports tasks such as fill-in-the-middle (FIM), code correction and test generation.\n\n### Codestral Models\n\nCodestral specializes in low-latency, high-frequency tasks such as fill-in-the-middle (FIM) and code generation. The latest version, Codestral 25.01 features a more efficient architecture and an improved tokenizer than the original, generating and completing code about 2 times faster.\n\n### API and Deployment\n\nMistral provides FIM support through their API infrastructure. The documentation includes a dedicated FIM endpoint that allows developers to use fill-in-the-middle completion with their models. Codestral can be queried using an additional completion mode called fill-in-the-middle (FIM).\n\n### Performance\n\nCodestral is now the clear leader for coding in its weight class, and SOTA (state-of-the-art) for FIM use cases across the board.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"45aa7718-2621-422b-8a03-309c465ec721","uuid":"8547ac6d-870a-43f0-820b-d751c4524adb","timestamp":"2026-09-11T19:51:02.179Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Mistral FIM fill-in-the-middle models support","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01MhRbEisrb4ty35sn5iDMLw","content":[{"title":"Codestral 25.01 | Mistral AI","url":"https://mistral.ai/news/codestral-2501/"},{"title":"Outscale | Mistral Docs","url":"https://docs.mistral.ai/deployment/cloud/outscale"},{"title":"Codestral - Mistral AI | Mistral Docs","url":"https://docs.mistral.ai/models/model-cards/codestral-25-08"},{"title":"Announcing Codestral 25.08 and the Complete Mistral Coding Stack for Enterprise | Mistral AI","url":"https://mistral.ai/news/codestral-25-08/"},{"title":"Models - from cloud to edge | Mistral","url":"https://mistral.ai/models/"},{"title":"Codestral | Mistral AI","url":"https://mistral.ai/news/codestral/"},{"title":"StarCoder: may the source be with you!","url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2305.06161"},{"title":"Fim Endpoints - Mistral AI Documentation","url":"https://docs.mistral.ai/api/endpoint/fim"},{"title":"StarCoder 2 and The Stack v2: The Next Generation","url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2402.19173"},{"title":"Planning-Aware Code Infilling via Horizon-Length Prediction","url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2410.03103"}]},"Based on the search results, here's what I found about Mistral FIM (Fill-in-the-Middle) models support:\n\n## Mistral's FIM Support\n\nCodestral is Mistral's family of code generation models built specifically for high-precision fill-in-the-middle (FIM) completion. Codestral supports tasks such as fill-in-the-middle (FIM), code correction and test generation.\n\n### Codestral Models\n\nCodestral specializes in low-latency, high-frequency tasks such as fill-in-the-middle (FIM) and code generation. The latest version, Codestral 25.01 features a more efficient architecture and an improved tokenizer than the original, generating and completing code about 2 times faster.\n\n### API and Deployment\n\nMistral provides FIM support through their API infrastructure. The documentation includes a dedicated FIM endpoint that allows developers to use fill-in-the-middle completion with their models. Codestral can be queried using an additional completion mode called fill-in-the-middle (FIM).\n\n### Performance\n\nCodestral is now the clear leader for coding in its weight class, and SOTA (state-of-the-art) for FIM use cases across the board."],"durationSeconds":6.461907457,"searchCount":1}}
