{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CexEXcYswxGKfF9tCQ4Uw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on Mistral's documentation, **Codestral** is the family of models that support FIM (fill-in-the-middle). The specific models include:\n\n- **Codestral 25.01** (latest) - Most efficient with improved performance, generating and completing code about 2x faster\n- **Codestral 25.08** - Previous version with full FIM support\n\nCodestral is specifically designed for high-precision fill-in-the-middle completion and other code generation tasks. Mistral states that Codestral is \"SOTA (state-of-the-art) for FIM use cases across the board.\"\n\nThe FIM capability is available through Mistral's API with a dedicated FIM endpoint that allows developers to query these models in fill-in-the-middle completion mode.\n\n**Sources:**\n- [FIM Endpoints - Mistral AI Documentation](https://docs.mistral.ai/api/endpoint/fim)\n- [Codestral - Mistral AI Documentation](https://docs.mistral.ai/models/model-cards/codestral-25-08)\n- [Codestral 25.01 Announcement](https://mistral.ai/news/codestral-2501/)\n- [Codestral 25.08 Announcement](https://mistral.ai/news/codestral-25-08/)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":865,"cache_read_input_tokens":21941,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":865},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"45aa7718-2621-422b-8a03-309c465ec721","uuid":"348f66a2-307d-446b-9cdc-bc9e224b9e17","timestamp":"2026-09-11T19:51:06.065Z","request_id":"req_011CexEXc1P2YCjTqCeftehX"}
